{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "109e6ac9d387dd24aad96661b94fceddbb796e47da799fe7508348a67ec0a5af", "ja": "もっと上手になりたいし、\nもうすこし、社長さんのモノマネの練習しようっと。", "zh": "我还想学得更像，\n再继续练习模仿社长一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "147ab3153343af254171ea09d3e986a8865045917edf804f80df8748c9211958", "ja": "これからも、\nアイドル諸君のことを、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "今后也要拜托你继续培育偶像们了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea5d75d359f6c4d19e6ff1a245bf404f0eb5099c0311cf20ae20bc1cfc56e477", "ja": "おはようございます。……あれっ？\n今、社長の声が聞こえた気がしたんですけど。", "zh": "早安……咦？\n我刚刚好像听见社长的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "2aed561eefc9d265efdc4fbad86df4f73a6d87541c4528acc89a3365e171c2ec", "ja": "き、気のせいだと思います！", "zh": "应、应该是你的错觉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "d5a4e8cae066be99fac4e39e4f286881ac043fadafbe5bac60b291a6df92709a", "ja": "私がかくし芸に何をするかは、\n忘年会まで隠しておかなくっちゃ……！", "zh": "在岁末餐会前，\n我都不能泄漏自己要表演的才艺……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "3ec3c6da03e1fbc5aaee282c7b2450e0e16a2b12cfe8d6c2c7a4470674d8e7f0", "ja": "それより、{$P$}さん！\n社長さんが呼んでいましたよ！", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}先生！\n社长在找你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bba331f53eed754b1288ed1e424f4b426f2f6fa6d3575362cb137d9684a4769a", "ja": "そうですか。\nじゃあ、事務所に行ってきます！", "zh": "这样啊。\n那我到事务所去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "d5fdf10f57b98ff064bfb202f482f70b3541765d64655dec86c43c73dc78ce40", "ja": "はーい♪　行ってらっしゃーい！\n外は寒いから、あったかくして出かけてくださいね～！", "zh": "好的～♪请慢走～！\n外面很冷，请穿得暖和一些再出门喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "eaaa06f2e42a08d4294ba18763fd2708da5da5c4e9e7d1176f5a6cf0b0ffb576", "ja": "音無君、君が選んだカードは、\nハートの7、スペードの6、クラブの5だね！", "zh": "音无，你选的牌是\n红心7、黑桃6、梅花5对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "41297b12f48251cd14a98262570c5a5b478955d5d44f50d85a149e1423d90cc1", "ja": "さ、3枚とも当たってる！\n社長、腕を上げましたね……！", "zh": "三、三张全都猜中了！\n社长，你又进步了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5da29d1c5595984a36b3bde58b5e4db86864a5aa2c02c13db45951d42f6745cf", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。\n……何をしているんですか？", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了。\n……请问你们在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "67e63611d206b386610742f32c568ea64950d64eff007124514c594aef362970", "ja": "おや、見られてしまったか。\nご覧の通り、忘年会のかくし芸の練習中だよ。", "zh": "哎呀，被你看到了啊。\n如你所见，我正在练习岁末餐会的才艺表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "a0f6a3f116f4c07f641c7cb9a0efea558977db786f42cd4e119ef0bddc1c6d54", "ja": "真壁君という手品のライバルがいるからね。\n気合いを入れて練習していたんだよ！", "zh": "毕竟有真壁这个魔术表演的对手在，\n我可是练习得很起劲喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "663da8fcfe93b6022e2a86415f9c02538197ae37ac7bcb6059b88a44377eb13d", "ja": "社長はトランプマジックの他にも、\nハトを出すマジックの練習もしているんですよ。", "zh": "社长除了扑克牌魔术，\n还练习了变出鸽子的魔术喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f934945f1e7c208511bdc7456f9d882ef71544ac5c4031e54cab5f6e2a89cb9b", "ja": "へぇ、それは面白そうですね！\nロコとか、すごく喜びそうです。", "zh": "哦，听起来满有趣的耶！\n感觉ROCO她们看了会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "ce14a6ea740e6ba863221ce7feb34aeddac3e6d31f172e221079e6e6823624aa", "ja": "忘年会では、頑張って、\n765匹ぐらいハトを出しちゃいましょう、社長！", "zh": "要在岁末餐会上，\n努力变出765只左右的鸽子喔，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "7fcf05a38a478c1dc918bcf8549f68a0a6e1a7950289222f3970cd3d87326d74", "ja": "うむ！　真壁君に勝つには、\nそれぐらいはしないとね！", "zh": "嗯！要想赢过真壁，\n起码得做到这种程度吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fd12ffd45b857d7e51872bbbd41527dcff611988c4c3c23680f37cbf902ac464", "ja": "とんでもない忘年会になりそうですね……。", "zh": "这次的岁末餐会感觉会很不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5929b2db3d40189c428f019a9d9c1385656d2088d89ab2a0f4a4dc6a06ee10be", "ja": "それより、社長。\n俺のことを呼んでいたと聞いたんですが……。", "zh": "话说回来，社长。\n听说你有事要找我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "eb817c9d4289418393cdf037514e7f6aca5deda96a3e45ed4dc299f9aa59f864", "ja": "ああ、実は、新しい曲が届いたから、\n早速、君に渡そうと思ってね。", "zh": "是啊，其实是新的歌曲送到了，\n我想赶快拿给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "b6f13e694faf88f5486e1742b12b2190980d2ed1ed413f019e8b4dc2625bd2ec", "ja": "その名も『PRETTY DREAMER』だ！", "zh": "歌名叫做『PRETTY DREAMER』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "f51b357746191f6d78102419b247c5c3745e368e78901c6b60fb875feebf13af", "ja": "ふふっ、夢を見るかわいい女の子たち……。\nアイドルのみんなにピッタリの歌ですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，追逐梦想的可爱女孩……\n这首歌相当适合偶像们呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "dbdf919d54f11f6245fa166da904804b3bd001c9ec36d84fa5e837f28a2cf16a", "ja": "そうですね。タイトルを聞いただけで、\nイメージが膨らみます！", "zh": "对啊，光是听歌名，\n脑中就充满了画面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "52a9add22bc99e40cea520f57f1ed18a0a3a2562e07657417272ed168efcfdc2", "ja": "うむ！　この曲を歌うメンバーの人選は、君に\n任せよう。お披露目を楽しみにしているからね？", "zh": "嗯！关于负责演唱的人选，就交给你了。\n我可是很期待这首歌亮相喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "9d816b1746963c2eca7c2030bafc83a2f686bbd393e01f15ee73bcdf4a61e578", "ja": "任せてください！　今年一番の思い出を、\nアイドルのファン達に届けてきます！", "zh": "请交给我吧！我会为偶像的粉丝们带来\n今年最美好的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "34d6db1121c7bfa5656bfd6e9dd6ef6d1bf4c24d1e4851a9492f84ac7e8a6b29", "ja": "いい意気込みだ！\nこれからもアイドル諸君のことを、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "你的决心很棒！\n今后也要拜托你继续培育偶像们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "bf95ac41dae65b6138587a56191ecccb878e59e216004848cbe6ef38716ae234", "ja": "（社長のそのセリフ、さっきも聞いたような……）", "zh": "（我怎么觉得刚刚好像也听过社长这句话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
